# Stream apply order for dash (imps unixutils, documentation-only).
#
# One stream per line; listed streams apply first, in this order, and any
# unlisted stream follows alphabetically. Comments (#) and blank lines are
# ignored.
#
# Both streams are comment-only (the family's one hard invariant, gated by
# `make check-comment-only`). They touch overlapping files (a book doc-region
# marker may bracket the same function a docs comment describes), so the order
# is pinned: `docs` first — the explanatory comments are the substance, the
# book markers are placed against whatever the commented tree ends up being.
docs
book
